\frac56=\\frac69"}],"StageId":1,"Question":{"Ar":"أي مقارنة صحيحة بين $\\frac56$ و$\\frac79$؟","En":"Which comparison between $\\frac56$ and $\\frac79$ is correct?"},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"قاعدة مقارنة الكسور ذات المقامات الموجبة: $a/b>c/d$ إذا وفقط إذا $ad>bc$.","En":"Fraction comparison rule for positive denominators: $a/b>c/d$ exactly when $ad>bc$."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"المقامان موجبان؛ نضرب تبادلياً دون تغيير اتجاه المقارنة.","En":"Both denominators are positive; cross multiplication preserves the comparison."},{"Ar":"$5\\times9=45$ و$7\\times6=42$. بما أن $45>42$ فالكسر الأول أكبر.","En":"$5\\times9=45$ and $7\\times6=42$. Since $45>42$, the first fraction is larger."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$\\frac56>\\frac79$","En":"$\\frac56>\\frac79$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تقارن البسطين وحدهما عند اختلاف المقامات.","En":"Do not compare numerators alone when denominators differ."},"FormulaLatex":"\\frac{a}{b}>\\frac{c}{d}\\Leftrightarrow ad>bc,\\quad b,d>0","Substitution":{"Ar":"$5\\times9=45,\\quad7\\times6=42$","En":"$5\\times9=45,\\quad7\\times6=42$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$5/6=15/18$ و$7/9=14/18$.","En":"$5/6=15/18$ and $7/9=14/18$."}},"TrackIds":[5],"CategoryId":21,"PrimarySkillId":112,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"يمكن المقارنة دون تحويل إلى عدد عشري.","En":"You can compare without converting to decimals."},{"Ar":"اضرب بسط كل كسر في مقام الكسر الآخر وقارن الناتجين.","En":"Cross-multiply the numerators and denominators, then compare the products."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"قاعدة مقارنة الكسور ذات المقامات الموجبة: $a/b>c/d$ إذا وفقط إذا $ad>bc$.","En":"Fraction comparison rule for positive denominators: $a/b>c/d$ exactly when $ad>bc$."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"المقامان موجبان؛ نضرب تبادلياً دون تغيير اتجاه المقارنة.","En":"Both denominators are positive; cross multiplication preserves the comparison."},{"Ar":"$5\\times9=45$ و$7\\times6=42$. بما أن $45>42$ فالكسر الأول أكبر.","En":"$5\\times9=45$ and $7\\times6=42$. Since $45>42$, the first fraction is larger."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$\\frac56>\\frac79$","En":"$\\frac56>\\frac79$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تقارن البسطين وحدهما عند اختلاف المقامات.","En":"Do not compare numerators alone when denominators differ."},"FormulaLatex":"\\frac{a}{b}>\\frac{c}{d}\\Leftrightarrow ad>bc,\\quad b,d>0","Substitution":{"Ar":"$5\\times9=45,\\quad7\\times6=42$","En":"$5\\times9=45,\\quad7\\times6=42$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$5/6=15/18$ و$7/9=14/18$.","En":"$5/6=15/18$ and $7/9=14/18$."}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"reversed-comparison","Reason":{"Ar":"45 أكبر من 42 وليس أصغر.","En":"45 exceeds 42 rather than being smaller."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"false-equivalence","Reason":{"Ar":"الحاصلان مختلفان فلا يتساوى الكسران.","En":"The cross products differ, so the fractions are unequal."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"false-equivalence","Reason":{"Ar":"6/9 يساوي 2/3، وليس 5/6.","En":"6/9 equals 2/3, not 5/6."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$قاعدة مقارنة الكسور ذات المقامات الموجبة: $a/b>c/d$ إذا وفقط إذا $ad>bc$.

$\frac{a}{b}>\frac{c}{d}\Leftrightarrow ad>bc,\quad b,d>0$

1. المقامان موجبان؛ نضرب تبادلياً دون تغيير اتجاه المقارنة.

2. $5\times9=45$ و$7\times6=42$. بما أن $45>42$ فالكسر الأول أكبر.

$5\times9=45,\quad7\times6=42$

$\frac56>\frac79$ بلا وحدة قياس

$5/6=15/18$ و$7/9=14/18$.

لا تقارن البسطين وحدهما عند اختلاف المقامات.$mw$,$mw$Fraction comparison rule for positive denominators: $a/b>c/d$ exactly when $ad>bc$.

$\frac{a}{b}>\frac{c}{d}\Leftrightarrow ad>bc,\quad b,d>0$

1. Both denominators are positive; cross multiplication preserves the comparison.

2. $5\times9=45$ and $7\times6=42$. Since $45>42$, the first fraction is larger.

$5\times9=45,\quad7\times6=42$

$\frac56>\frac79$ Dimensionless

$5/6=15/18$ and $7/9=14/18$.

Do not compare numerators alone when denominators differ.$mw$),
