$34$ Dimensionless

$\frac{34}{340}\times100\%=10\%$

Do not multiply by the whole-number rate without dividing by 100.$mw$),
(666,618,$mw$11248672739110CE6ECF618F681484036F69A3D30B53C0B791E4E200D99F1D93$mw$,$mw$cda0c7ffa2810a98b77bbada9252e35a$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":618,"StageId":1,"CategoryId":21,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"ربط خمسة بالمئة بنصف العشرة بالمئة","TitleEn":"Find five percent using ten percent","QuestionTextAr":"يعرف طالب أن 10% من العدد 260 تساوي 26. فكم تساوي 5% من العدد نفسه؟","QuestionTextEn":"A pupil knows that 10% of 260 is 26. What is 5% of the same amount?","DetailedSolutionAr":"المبدأ المستخدم: 5% هو نصف 10%، لأن 5 = 10 ÷ 2. بما أن 10% من 260 هو 26، فنحسب 5% = 26 ÷ 2 = 13. التحقق: 260 × 5/100 = 13.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Rule used: 5% is half of 10%. Given that 10% of 260 is 26, half of 26 is 26 ÷ 2 = 13. Check directly: 260 × 5/100 = 13.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":2461,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"5","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":2462,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"13","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":2463,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"26","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":2464,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"52","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"خمسة بالمئة نصف عشرة بالمئة.","En":"Five percent is half of ten percent."},{"Ar":"اقسم المقدار المعطى لعشرة بالمئة على اثنين.","En":"Divide the given ten-percent amount by two."}],"Title":{"Ar":"ربط خمسة بالمئة بنصف العشرة بالمئة","En":"Find five percent using ten percent"},"Points":10,"Options":[{"Reason":{"Ar":"5 هو المعدل المئوي، لا مقدار الجزء.","En":"5 is the percentage rate, not the amount."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"5"},{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"13"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"26 هو مقدار عشرة بالمئة، وهو ضعف المطلوب.","En":"26 is ten percent, twice the requested amount."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"26"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"52 يضاعف عشرة بالمئة بدلاً من تنصيفها.","En":"52 doubles ten percent instead of halving it."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"52"}],"StageId":1,"Question":{"Ar":"يعرف طالب أن 10% من العدد 260 تساوي 26. فكم تساوي 5% من العدد نفسه؟","En":"A pupil knows that 10% of 260 is 26. What is 5% of the same amount?"},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"النسبة من كمية تساوي الكمية مضروبة في النسبة بعد قسمتها على مئة.","En":"A percentage of a quantity equals the quantity times the rate divided by 100."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"خمسة بالمئة نصف عشرة بالمئة من الكمية نفسها.","En":"Five percent is half of ten percent of the same quantity."},{"Ar":"نقسم القيمة المعطاة 26 على اثنين: 26/2=13.","En":"Divide the given ten-percent amount 26 by two: 26/2=13."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$13$","En":"$13$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تضرب في النسبة كعدد صحيح دون القسمة على مئة.","En":"Do not multiply by the whole-number rate without dividing by 100."},"FormulaLatex":"Q=T\\frac{p}{100}","Substitution":{"Ar":"$260\\times\\frac{5}{100}=13$","En":"$260\\times\\frac{5}{100}=13$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$\\frac{13}{260}\\times100\\%=5\\%$","En":"$\\frac{13}{260}\\times100\\%=5\\%$"}},"TrackIds":[6],"CategoryId":21,"PrimarySkillId":93,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"خمسة بالمئة نصف عشرة بالمئة.","En":"Five percent is half of ten percent."},{"Ar":"اقسم المقدار المعطى لعشرة بالمئة على اثنين.","En":"Divide the given ten-percent amount by two."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"النسبة من كمية تساوي الكمية مضروبة في النسبة بعد قسمتها على مئة.","En":"A percentage of a quantity equals the quantity times the rate divided by 100."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"خمسة بالمئة نصف عشرة بالمئة من الكمية نفسها.","En":"Five percent is half of ten percent of the same quantity."},{"Ar":"نقسم القيمة المعطاة 26 على اثنين: 26/2=13.","En":"Divide the given ten-percent amount 26 by two: 26/2=13."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$13$","En":"$13$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تضرب في النسبة كعدد صحيح دون القسمة على مئة.","En":"Do not multiply by the whole-number rate without dividing by 100."},"FormulaLatex":"Q=T\\frac{p}{100}","Substitution":{"Ar":"$260\\times\\frac{5}{100}=13$","En":"$260\\times\\frac{5}{100}=13$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$\\frac{13}{260}\\times100\\%=5\\%$","En":"$\\frac{13}{260}\\times100\\%=5\\%$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"5 هو المعدل المئوي، لا مقدار الجزء.","En":"5 is the percentage rate, not the amount."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"26 هو مقدار عشرة بالمئة، وهو ضعف المطلوب.","En":"26 is ten percent, twice the requested amount."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"52 يضاعف عشرة بالمئة بدلاً من تنصيفها.","En":"52 doubles ten percent instead of halving it."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$النسبة من كمية تساوي الكمية مضروبة في النسبة بعد قسمتها على مئة.

$Q=T\frac{p}{100}$

1. خمسة بالمئة نصف عشرة بالمئة من الكمية نفسها.

2. نقسم القيمة المعطاة 26 على اثنين: 26/2=13.

$260\times\frac{5}{100}=13$

$13$ بلا وحدة قياس

$\frac{13}{260}\times100\%=5\%$

لا تضرب في النسبة كعدد صحيح دون القسمة على مئة.$mw$,$mw$A percentage of a quantity equals the quantity times the rate divided by 100.

$Q=T\frac{p}{100}$

