$260\times\frac{5}{100}=13$

$13$ Dimensionless

$\frac{13}{260}\times100\%=5\%$

Do not multiply by the whole-number rate without dividing by 100.$mw$),
(668,620,$mw$E3A356A6BCFF3DD1CC8F3AE4F0C652D3BF80ED9301B6DA996230BD0F9C8AD469$mw$,$mw$41c4af7bf1abf0da1d35a023c17811da$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":620,"StageId":1,"CategoryId":21,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"تحديد مقدار الخصم لا السعر النهائي","TitleEn":"Distinguish discount amount from final price","QuestionTextAr":"سعر حقيبة 80 وحدة نقدية. إذا كان الخصم 25%، فما **قيمة الخصم**؟","QuestionTextEn":"A bag costs 80 units of currency. With a 25% discount, what is the **discount amount**?","DetailedSolutionAr":"القانون المستخدم: مقدار الخصم = السعر الأصلي × نسبة الخصم. بما أن 25% = 1/4 وسعر الحقيبة 80 وحدة، نحسب الخصم = 80 ÷ 4 = 20 وحدة. السعر بعد الخصم 80 − 20 = 60، لكنه ليس المطلوب؛ المطلوب قيمة الخصم 20.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Rule used: Discount amount = original price × discount rate. Since 25% = 1/4, the discount on 80 units is 80 ÷ 4 = 20 units. The price after discount is 60, but the question asks for the 20-unit discount.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":2469,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"15","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":2470,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"20","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":2471,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"25","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":2472,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"60","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"النسبة المئوية تعني جزءاً من مئة.","En":"A percentage means a part out of one hundred."},{"Ar":"اضرب الكمية الأصلية في النسبة المكتوبة على مئة.","En":"Multiply the original quantity by the rate written over 100."}],"Title":{"Ar":"تحديد مقدار الخصم لا السعر النهائي","En":"Distinguish discount amount from final price"},"Points":10,"Options":[{"Reason":{"Ar":"15 يمثل 18.75% من 80، وليس 25%.","En":"15 represents 18.75% of 80, not 25%."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"15"},{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"20"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"25 هو معدل الخصم وليس قيمته النقدية.","En":"25 is the discount rate, not the monetary amount."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"25"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"60 هو السعر بعد الخصم، وليس الخصم.","En":"60 is the discounted price, not the discount."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"60"}],"StageId":1,"Question":{"Ar":"سعر حقيبة 80 وحدة نقدية. إذا كان الخصم 25%، فما **قيمة الخصم**؟","En":"A bag costs 80 units of currency. With a 25% discount, what is the **discount amount**?"},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"قيمة الخصم تساوي السعر الأصلي مضروباً في معدل الخصم.","En":"Discount amount equals original price times the discount rate."},"Unit":{"Ar":"وحدة نقدية","En":"currency units"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"نحوّل $25\\%$ إلى $\\frac14$.","En":"Convert $25\\%$ to $\\frac14$."},{"Ar":"قيمة الخصم تساوي ربع السعر الأصلي: 80/4=20.","En":"The discount amount is one quarter of the original price: 80/4=20."},{"Ar":"السعر بعد الخصم 60، لكن المطلوب قيمة الخصم نفسها.","En":"The final price is 60, but the requested quantity is the discount itself."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$20$","En":"$20$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"المطلوب قيمة الخصم لا السعر بعد الخصم.","En":"The question asks for the discount, not the final price."},"FormulaLatex":"Q=T\\frac{p}{100}","Substitution":{"Ar":"$80\\times\\frac{25}{100}=20$","En":"$80\\times\\frac{25}{100}=20$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$\\frac{20}{80}\\times100\\%=25\\%$","En":"$\\frac{20}{80}\\times100\\%=25\\%$"}},"TrackIds":[6],"CategoryId":21,"PrimarySkillId":93,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"النسبة المئوية تعني جزءاً من مئة.","En":"A percentage means a part out of one hundred."},{"Ar":"اضرب الكمية الأصلية في النسبة المكتوبة على مئة.","En":"Multiply the original quantity by the rate written over 100."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"قيمة الخصم تساوي السعر الأصلي مضروباً في معدل الخصم.","En":"Discount amount equals original price times the discount rate."},"Unit":{"Ar":"وحدة نقدية","En":"currency units"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"نحوّل $25\\%$ إلى $\\frac14$.","En":"Convert $25\\%$ to $\\frac14$."},{"Ar":"قيمة الخصم تساوي ربع السعر الأصلي: 80/4=20.","En":"The discount amount is one quarter of the original price: 80/4=20."},{"Ar":"السعر بعد الخصم 60، لكن المطلوب قيمة الخصم نفسها.","En":"The final price is 60, but the requested quantity is the discount itself."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$20$","En":"$20$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"المطلوب قيمة الخصم لا السعر بعد الخصم.","En":"The question asks for the discount, not the final price."},"FormulaLatex":"Q=T\\frac{p}{100}","Substitution":{"Ar":"$80\\times\\frac{25}{100}=20$","En":"$80\\times\\frac{25}{100}=20$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$\\frac{20}{80}\\times100\\%=25\\%$","En":"$\\frac{20}{80}\\times100\\%=25\\%$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"15 يمثل 18.75% من 80، وليس 25%.","En":"15 represents 18.75% of 80, not 25%."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"25 هو معدل الخصم وليس قيمته النقدية.","En":"25 is the discount rate, not the monetary amount."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"60 هو السعر بعد الخصم، وليس الخصم.","En":"60 is the discounted price, not the discount."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$قيمة الخصم تساوي السعر الأصلي مضروباً في معدل الخصم.

$Q=T\frac{p}{100}$

1. نحوّل $25\%$ إلى $\frac14$.

2. قيمة الخصم تساوي ربع السعر الأصلي: 80/4=20.

3. السعر بعد الخصم 60، لكن المطلوب قيمة الخصم نفسها.

$80\times\frac{25}{100}=20$

$20$ وحدة نقدية

$\frac{20}{80}\times100\%=25\%$

المطلوب قيمة الخصم لا السعر بعد الخصم.$mw$,$mw$Discount amount equals original price times the discount rate.

$Q=T\frac{p}{100}$

1. Convert $25\%$ to $\frac14$.

2. The discount amount is one quarter of the original price: 80/4=20.

3. The final price is 60, but the requested quantity is the discount itself.

$80\times\frac{25}{100}=20$

$20$ currency units

$\frac{20}{80}\times100\%=25\%$

