(669,621,$mw$59DF5DAA26ACE44817DE08ACD9E894BC8B759AB3A253829C59BFD6C1DD44E8A6$mw$,$mw$035abcaa8ede235df08bfcb73f4536ed$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":621,"StageId":2,"CategoryId":6,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"حل معادلة خطية تتضمن أقواساً","TitleEn":"Solve a linear equation with brackets","QuestionTextAr":"حل المعادلة: 4(x − 3) = 28.","QuestionTextEn":"Solve 4(x − 3) = 28.","DetailedSolutionAr":"المبدأ المستخدم: في المعادلة 4(س − 3) = 28، يمكن فك الضرب بقسمة الطرفين على 4 أولاً. نحصل على س − 3 = 28 ÷ 4 = 7، ثم نضيف 3 إلى الطرفين: س = 10. التحقق: 4 × (10 − 3) = 4 × 7 = 28.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Rule used: Undo the outer multiplication before the subtraction. From 4(x − 3) = 28, divide both sides by 4 to obtain x − 3 = 7. Add 3 to both sides: x = 10. Check: 4 × (10 − 3) = 28.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":2473,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"4","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":2474,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"7","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":2475,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"10","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":2476,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"15","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"ابدأ بإزالة عامل الضرب خارج القوس.","En":"Start by undoing the factor outside parentheses."},{"Ar":"اقسم الطرفين على 4 ثم أضف 3.","En":"Divide both sides by 4, then add 3."}],"Title":{"Ar":"حل معادلة خطية تتضمن أقواساً","En":"Solve a linear equation with brackets"},"Points":10,"Options":[{"Reason":{"Ar":"4 ينتج من طرح 3 بدلاً من إضافتها إلى 7.","En":"4 subtracts 3 from 7 instead of adding it."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"4"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"7 هو قيمة التعبير داخل القوس وليس قيمة المجهول.","En":"7 is the value of the parenthesized expression, not the unknown."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"7"},{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"10"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"15 يعطي 48 في الطرف الأيسر، لا 28.","En":"15 gives 48 on the left, not 28."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"15"}],"StageI